    "reset the simulator to the seed state",
    "let the hub read the matrix (/ws get_status), so it is in sync before the action",
    "setup (api): request(method='PUT', path='/api/v2/scenes/scene_goodnight01', json={'steps': [{'type': 'profile', 'id': 'retro_hour'}], 'overrides': {'retro_hour': {'2': {'enabled': True}}}}) -> HTTP 200",
