    "  open /ui and wait until the app has loaded its data",
    "  open the Settings drawer on the Scenes tab (#settings/scenes)",
    "  click Execute on scene scene_goodnight01",
    "  the page sent POST /api/v2/scenes/scene_goodnight01/execute -> HTTP 200",
    "  the page shows: success: Scene executed",
    "cleanup (api): request(method='PUT', path='/api/v2/scenes/scene_goodnight01', json={'name': 'Good Night', 'steps': [{'type': 'system_action', 'id': 'mute_all_audio'}, {'type': 'macro', 'id': 'macro_all_off'}], 'overrides': {}}) -> HTTP 200"
